<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>오늘의 서랍</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/drawer.css?v=20260823">
</head>
<body>
<main class="page-shell">
    <section class="drawer-header" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">익명의 편지가 머무는 곳</p>
        <h1 id="page-title">오늘의 서랍</h1>
        <p class="intro">서랍 하나를 열어 이름 모를 누군가가 남겨둔 편지를 발견해보세요.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="cabinet-section" aria-label="서랍장">
        <div class="cabinet-top">
            <div>
                <strong>{{page}}번 서랍장</strong>
            </div>
            <a class="write-link" href="/letter/new?writerType={{writerType}}">편지 넣기</a>
        </div>

        <div class="cabinet" role="grid" aria-label="{{page}}번 서랍장, 4행 4열">
            {{#rows}}
                <div class="drawer-row" role="row">
                    {{#drawers}}
                        <a class="drawer" href="/letter/{{number}}" role="gridcell" aria-label="{{number}}번 서랍 열기">
                            <span class="drawer-number">{{number}}</span>
                            <span class="drawer-pull" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                        </a>
                    {{/drawers}}
                </div>
            {{/rows}}
        </div>

        <nav class="pager" aria-label="서랍장 페이지">
            {{#previousPage}}
                <a href="/home?page={{previousPage}}&writerType={{writerType}}">이전 서랍장</a>
            {{/previousPage}}
            <span>{{page}}번 서랍장</span>
            <a href="/home?page={{nextPage}}&writerType={{writerType}}">다음 서랍장</a>
        </nav>
    </section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
